      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm working on a deck for some high-end luxury clients who want to understand the current social media landscape. i need to categorize a few different vibes/slang terms so they know which ones are \"premium\" for their brand image and which ones are more \"niche/street-level\" or not really fit for a high-class audience. \n\ncan u help me group these into \"sophisticated/mainstream\" vs \"informal/urban\" or \"low-brow\" types?\n\n1. \"Quiet Luxury\"\n2. \"No cap\"\n3. \"Old Money aesthetic\"\n4. \"Finna\"\n5. \"Clean girl aesthetic\"\n6. \"On god\"\n7. \"Minimalism\"\n8. \"Main character energy\" \n\nbasically just tell me which ones feel high-end and which ones feel more like street slang or lower socio-economic vibes.",
